{"3745390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blunt Blade and a Hundred Halls", "steam_appid": 3745390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've stayed too late playing video games, and your dad locked you up in the basement to teach you a lesson. There's a devil living inside the wall there, and it craves meat. It gives you an old sword. It's time to...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.poster.avif?t=1773679607\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.webm?t=1773679607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745390/extras/c4ab70d09d0501973dbb85c6d9d2a99c.mp4?t=1773679607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blunt Blade and a Hundred Halls</strong> (BBaaHH for short), you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, push your luck, die, respawn and go killing again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever-changing dungeon with 100 chambers full of mutated freaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill said freaks and vacuum their body parts (SPLOOOSH!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount their heads on the cellar wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind their meat in the grinder and get paid in gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades from the devil that lives in your basement walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your blade sharp, because it will become battered in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and slot perk-granting po